msgid "ReliefOS 5.3.3"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.3.3"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"控制台安装器改用 ncursesw "
"TUI，与图形向导共用安装和更新后端，提供语言、许可证、磁盘、引导、分区、账户、确认及进度页面。分区页支持可选择的分区表格、容量示意条、空闲区和独立的破坏性操作确认。"
msgstr ""
"The console installer now uses a ncursesw TUI and shares its installation and update backend with"
" the graphical wizard. It provides language, license, disk, bootloader, partition, account, "
"confirmation and progress pages. The partition page includes a selectable table, a capacity bar, "
"free-space regions and separate confirmation for destructive operations."

msgid "安装器更新流程复用经过校验的离线缓存，显示阶段、进度和活动详情；更新旧系统时保留仍被引用的旧内核 bundle，避免清理回退启动所需的文件。"
msgstr ""
"Installer updates reuse verified offline caches and show the current stage, progress and "
"activity. Updates to older systems preserve referenced kernel bundles so that cleanup does not "
"remove files needed for fallback boot."

msgid "新增 ReliefSettings，提供当前用户的语言、显示模式和键盘布局设置，以及通过认证修改全系统时区的功能。显示预览支持超时恢复，并整合网络和服务管理入口。"
msgstr ""
"Added ReliefSettings for per-user language, display mode and keyboard layout, plus authenticated "
"changes to the system-wide time zone. Display previews revert on timeout, and the application "
"links to network and service management."

msgid "自研应用改用各自的 gettext 翻译域，提供日语界面、区域数据和桌面入口；文档及网站新增英文、日文版本和对应的语言导航。"
msgstr ""
"First-party applications now use separate gettext domains and provide Japanese interfaces, locale"
" data and desktop entries. The manuals and website add English and Japanese editions with "
"language navigation."

msgid ""
"Fileman 集成可移动存储设备的识别、挂载、打开、安全弹出和占用诊断。Diskmgr、Fileman、安装器与 initramfs 增加 ext3 类型识别和配套操作；手动安装可选择 "
"ext3 根分区，默认自动布局仍使用 ext4。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman integrates removable-storage discovery, mounting, opening, safe eject and busy-device "
"diagnostics. Diskmgr, Fileman, the installer and initramfs recognize ext3 and provide "
"corresponding operations. Manual installation can use an ext3 root; automatic layouts still "
"default to ext4."

msgid ""
"新增 ReliefClipboard，支持 X11 标准剪贴板交接、文本、图片和文件复制粘贴。历史默认跨登录保存，可搜索、暂停记录或清空；Fileman 支持跨实例复制与剪切，Paint "
"支持图片剪贴板。"
msgstr ""
"Added ReliefClipboard with standard X11 clipboard handover and copying and pasting of text, "
"images and files. Searchable history persists across logins by default and can be paused or "
"cleared. Fileman supports copying and cutting between instances, and Paint supports image "
"clipboard operations."

msgid "Taskmgr 的启动应用程序页接入 XDG Autostart，支持添加、编辑、启用、禁用、删除或恢复默认项目；IceWM 登录会话使用对应启动器处理标准 Desktop Entry 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The Taskmgr startup-applications page now manages XDG Autostart entries, including adding, "
"editing, enabling, disabling, deleting and restoring defaults. The IceWM login session uses the "
"corresponding launcher to process standard Desktop Entry configuration."

msgid "Network Controller 和启动服务按网卡分别管理 DHCP、静态 IPv4、禁用状态和配置备份，汇总各接口的 DNS 信息，并保留旧 eth0 配置的迁移路径。"
msgstr ""
"Network Controller and startup services manage DHCP, static IPv4, disabled state and "
"configuration backups per interface. They combine DNS information from individual interfaces and "
"retain a migration path for older eth0 configuration."

msgid "X11 默认浏览器切换到 NetSurf，固定其 curl 依赖；更新 Xorg APK 到 21.1.26-r0，并更新失效的 Vim 下载锁及 exfatprogs 1.4.4 依赖。"
msgstr ""
"The default X11 browser is now NetSurf with pinned curl dependencies. Xorg APKs move to "
"21.1.26-r0, and obsolete Vim download pins and the exfatprogs 1.4.4 dependency are updated."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**是，涉及已退役的私有诊断接口和资源路径。** 移除内核诊断会话的用户态接口、独立载荷和镜像集成；依赖旧诊断入口的程序或脚本需要迁移。共享的 leonos "
"翻译目录改为各应用独立域，自定义翻译必须按新目录和域名安装。没有改变标准 Linux syscall 编号，也不要求转换现有文件系统。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: retired private diagnostic interfaces and resource paths.** The userspace interface, "
"standalone payload and image integration for kernel diagnostic sessions have been removed. "
"Programs or scripts using the old diagnostic entry points must migrate. The shared leonos "
"translation catalog has been replaced by per-application domains; custom translations must use "
"the new directories and domain names. Standard Linux syscall numbers are unchanged, and existing "
"filesystems do not require conversion."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Upgrade and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**源码 Release**，只提供标签和 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译 ISO、磁盘镜像、安装器、SDK 或 APK。递归初始化标签固定的子模块；依赖缓存不足时显式执行 "
"``make fetch``。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release**, containing a tag and GitHub-generated source archives only. No "
"prebuilt ISO, disk image, installer, SDK or APK is attached. Initialize submodules recursively at"
" the revisions pinned by the tag; run ``make fetch`` explicitly if dependency caches are "
"incomplete."

msgid "设置中心的用户配置遵循 XDG 目录，语言更改在下次登录生效；时区为全系统设置。自启动修改同样在下次登录生效，禁用系统项目通过个人覆盖实现，不删除系统原文件。"
msgstr ""
"Per-user settings follow XDG directories. Language changes take effect at the next login; the "
"time zone is system-wide. Autostart changes also apply at the next login. Disabling a system "
"entry creates a per-user override rather than deleting the system file."

msgid "剪贴板历史默认持久化，可能包含复制过的私密内容；可在设置中关闭“退出登录后保留历史”并清除磁盘历史。私有目录和文件分别使用 0700、0600 权限。"
msgstr ""
"Clipboard history persists by default and may contain copied private information. Disable "
"persistence in the settings to remove disk history. Private directories and files use modes 0700 "
"and 0600 respectively."

msgid ""
"ext3 使用内部日志和 ``data=ordered``；安装器会在目标 fstab 保存所选文件系统。自动分区仍会擦除所选磁盘，格式化、删除和重新分区前必须核对目标并备份。完整的 ext3 "
"安装器实际安装流程尚未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"ext3 uses an internal journal and ``data=ordered``; the installer records the selected filesystem"
" in the target fstab. Automatic partitioning still erases the selected disk. Verify the target "
"and back up data before formatting, deleting or repartitioning. A complete ext3 installation "
"through the actual installer has not yet been validated."

msgid ""
"发行定向检查覆盖版本头、数字字段、``VERSION_ID`` 和两仓中英日文档。本次未重建发行镜像，也未重新执行完整系统测试；既有功能开发期间的 QEMU 结果不等于整版复验。**VMware"
" 验证未完成**，实体硬件和长期稳定性未完成本版验收。"
msgstr ""
"Targeted release checks cover version headers, numeric fields, ``VERSION_ID`` and both "
"repositories' Chinese, English and Japanese manuals. Release images were not rebuilt, and the "
"complete system test suite was not rerun. QEMU results recorded during feature development are "
"not a complete retest of this release. **VMware validation remains incomplete**; physical "
"hardware and long-term stability have not completed release acceptance."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"``configs/build-version`` 为 **5.3.3**，生成数字字段为 **5/3/3**，``/etc/os-release`` 的 ``VERSION_ID`` 为 "
"**5.3.3**。ReliefNT v5.3.3 的源码、模块 ABI 和文档由内核仓独立固定，主仓使用对应 gitlink。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/build-version`` is **5.3.3**, generated numeric fields are **5/3/3**, and "
"``VERSION_ID`` in ``/etc/os-release`` is **5.3.3**. ReliefNT v5.3.3 independently fixes kernel "
"source, module ABI and documentation; the parent repository uses the corresponding gitlink."

msgid ""
"应用翻译按 ``configs/nls/DOMAINS`` 和 ``configs/nls/LINGUAS`` 构建；修改文案时更新对应应用目录。移除的诊断载荷不影响普通内核符号文件和 "
"debug profile。"
msgstr ""
"Application translations build from ``configs/nls/DOMAINS`` and ``configs/nls/LINGUAS``. Update "
"the relevant application catalog when changing messages. Removing the diagnostic payload does not"
" remove normal kernel symbol files or the debug profile."

msgid ""
"本次范围为上一版本提交 **451105bced434f9fc941c377f7d5ae9f79c53d62** 之后至本次 5.3.3 版本提交；仅汇总主仓最终生效内容，排除 ReliefNT"
" 实现、纯合并和纯 gitlink 更新。下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"This release covers commits after the previous version commit "
"**451105bced434f9fc941c377f7d5ae9f79c53d62** through the 5.3.3 version commit. It summarizes only"
" effective parent-repository changes, excluding ReliefNT implementation, pure merges and gitlink-"
"only updates. The next release starts from this version commit."
